      "summary": "<p> <img alt=\"Halfords has added 74 per cent to its share price in the year to date\" src=\"https://www.cityam.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/summer-colleague-hac-tyre-check-incidental1-1.jpg?w=1200\" /> </p>Halfords has improved its profit target for the second time in a matter of months, as the motoring retailer continues to benefit from a surge in sales during the hot summer months. The FTSE 250 firm said it plans to reinvest some of the \u00a38m extra revenue it took during this year\u2019s heatwaves, as record <a href=\"https://www.cityam.com/halfords-lifts-profit-hopes-again-as-motoring-retailer-revs-up/\">[...]</a>",
